window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-04a85e845544535d"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"annotations-extensibility\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"api\">浏览器批注 API 扩展能力</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在页面网址末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可查看文档的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>浏览器批注 API 可让你自定义网站上的批注体验：用户可以选择哪些内容、反馈附带哪些上下文，以及在将批注发送给 ChatGPT 前使用哪些控件预览更改。</p> <p>在 ChatGPT Enterprise 和 Edu 工作区中，管理员必须通过工作区策略允许 <strong>Site annotation customizations（网站批注自定义）</strong>。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-comment-on-the-page\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">浏览器批注（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a> 无需修改代码即可用于你的网站。 用户可以选中页面的一部分、添加评论，然后将其连同上下文一起发送给 Codex 或 ChatGPT Work。</p> <p>作为开发者，你可以使用浏览器批注 API 提供与你的应用相对应的上下文或控件。 例如，在设计系统预览中，你可以为组件的不同变体附加预览，帮助开发者了解如何更新网站上的组件。</p> <p>如果你需要了解浏览器批注 API，或希望为网站添加批注支持，可以安装“批注扩展能力”插件。</p> <p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/plugins/Plugin_94f13f4285908191bb882d31b1ffc59e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">安装“批注扩展能力”插件（需联网）</a></p> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p>在本指南中实际体验浏览器批注 API。</p> <ol> <li>在 ChatGPT 内置浏览器中打开本页面。</li> <li>尝试打开此卡片中显示的建议提示词。</li> <li>进入<a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-comment-on-the-page\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">批注模式（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>，然后选择下方的表格或代码示例，在预设布局和主题之间切换。</li> <li>你仍然可以批注页面上的任意项目，并查看默认批注效果。</li> </ol> <p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/codex/deeplink?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.chatgpt.com%2Fdocs%2Fannotations-extensibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 ChatGPT 浏览器中打开（需联网）</a></p> <p><a id=\"choose-what-to-customize\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">选择要自定义的内容</h2> <p>请根据你的网站选择合适的集成方式：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>目标</th> <th>集成方式</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>让卡片或其他一组元素作为一个对象被选中</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=customize-selection-targets\">选择目标</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>允许用户选择一个短语或句子</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=enable-text-selection\">文本选择容器</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>为所选内容附加额外上下文</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=add-context-to-a-selection\">选择元数据</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>通过你自己的按钮打开批注并预填建议评论</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=open-an-annotation-from-your-website\">批注请求</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>从你自己的界面请求用户针对指定段落提供反馈</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=request-an-annotation-for-a-text-range\">文本范围请求</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>打开批注时显示高级控件</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=choose-the-editors-default-mode\">编辑器默认模式</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>预览应用属性或收集用户选择</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=add-custom-controls\">自定义控件</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>选择画布中绘制的单个对象</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=make-canvas-objects-selectable\">批注表面</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>从你的网站开启或关闭批注模式</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=control-annotation-mode\">批注模式控件</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>本指南适用于 DevDay 2026 版及更新版本的 ChatGPT 桌面应用。 在应用内置浏览器中，安全的顶层页面（例如 HTTPS 或 localhost 页面）可通过 <code>document.oai.annotation</code> 使用此 JavaScript API。启用后，浏览器会在网页脚本运行前安装该 API。请逐个检测所需方法是否存在，以兼容较旧或不支持此功能的浏览器；等 DOM 元素创建完成后，再初始化集成。无需等待就绪事件，也无需轮询。</p> <p>API 方法会同步返回，注册句柄也会立即可用；批注编辑器可以在之后继续加载。表面的 <code>hitTest</code> 回调可以返回 Promise。</p> <p><a id=\"customize-selection-targets\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">自定义选择目标</h2> <p>默认情况下，批注模式会从页面 DOM 中选择元素，优先选择文本、图片和控件等目标。若要让较大的整体对象也可被选中，请在其容器区域添加 <code>oai-annotation-container</code>，并在可选中的后代元素上添加 <code>oai-annotatable</code>。</p> <p>以下示例将图表卡片设为一个整体选择对象：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;section oai-annotation-container&gt;\n  &lt;article id=\"chart-card\" oai-annotatable=\"Q3 Revenue\"&gt;\n    &lt;h2&gt;Q3 Revenue&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;$120,000 this quarter&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;button type=\"button\"&gt;More info&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/article&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>将指针移到卡片中的任意位置，都会高亮整张卡片。可选的 <code>oai-annotatable</code> 属性值会作为对象名称展示给用户和模型。名称应能区分相邻对象；也可以不提供该值。</p> <p>容器决定这些选择规则的适用范围。单独添加 <code>oai-annotatable</code> 属性不会改变选择行为。 在容器内部，浏览器会选择包含指针下方元素的最近一个已标记目标。容器嵌套时，采用距离最近的容器。容器内未标记的区域会创建网页批注；所有容器之外的区域则保持默认行为。</p> <p><a id=\"enable-text-selection\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">启用文本选择</h2> <p>在某个区域添加 <code>oai-annotation-container-text</code>，即可允许用户在批注模式下拖动选择文本。此属性无需设置值：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;article oai-annotation-container-text&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Design guidelines&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Use consistent spacing between related components.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Leave more space between separate groups.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/article&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>松开鼠标后，如果选中了非空文本，系统会打开文本批注编辑器，并附带选中范围及其上下文。只点击而未选中任何文本不会创建批注。按 <strong>Escape</strong> 或取消当前手势即可取消选择。</p> <p>手势的起始方式由最近的文本选择容器或 DOM 选择容器决定。文本容器不会使用 <code>oai-annotatable</code> 标记来选择元素。若要恢复元素选择，请嵌套 <code>oai-annotation-container</code>；若要恢复文本选择，请嵌套文本容器。如果同一元素同时具有这两种属性，则优先进行文本选择。</p> <p>文本选择遵循页面本身的常规选择规则，选中范围可以超出起始容器。容器不会裁剪选区，也不会让 iframe 内的文本变得可选。文本字段仍可被选中，但在批注模式下，普通页面点击和控件的原生操作仍会被拦截。显式调用 <code>request()</code> 时，行为不变。</p> <p>只有在批注模式下，且网站批注功能和该网站的单独设置均已启用时，文本选择容器才会生效。</p> <p><a id=\"add-context-to-a-selection\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">为选中内容添加上下文</h2> <p>在已标记的目标上添加 <code>oai-annotation-metadata</code>，可附带页面上可能不可见的上下文。例如，虚构的联系人行可以包含电子邮件地址，供用户请求起草邮件时使用：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;section oai-annotation-container&gt;\n  &lt;div\n    id=\"contact-row\"\n    oai-annotatable=\"Alex Morgan\"\n    oai-annotation-metadata='{\"email\":\"alex@example.com\"}'\n  &gt;\n    &lt;div&gt;Alex Morgan&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div&gt;Project lead&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-metadata\"> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p><strong>Alex Morgan</strong></p> <p>项目负责人</p> <p>在批注模式下选中该联系人，即可看到电子邮件地址被附加到上下文中。</p> <blockquote> <p>本地静态示意：不执行官网批注交互，按钮与画布操作在本地不可用。 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-metadata\">官网交互原文（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>选择其中任意一行都会选中整行。元数据会显示在批注中，并随批注一起进入对话。只应加入你打算同时提供给用户和模型的上下文。若要实际发送邮件，仍需要连接电子邮件工具。</p> <p>请使用简短、扁平的 JSON 对象，并遵守以下限制：</p> <ul> <li>最多包含 6 个属性；值可以是字符串、有限数值、布尔值或 <code>null</code>。</li> <li>键最多 64 个字符，字符串值最多 256 个字符。</li> <li>序列化后的对象最多 2,048 字节。</li> </ul> <p>键必须以 ASCII 字母开头，且只能包含 ASCII 字母、数字、空格、下划线或连字符。单词之间使用一个空格。不支持嵌套对象和数组。无效元数据会被浏览器忽略。</p> <p>你也可以通过 <code>request()</code> 或表面的 <code>hitTest</code> 返回结果提供元数据。</p> <p><a id=\"open-an-annotation-from-your-website\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">从你的网站打开批注</h2> <p>请直接在用户交互中调用 <code>document.oai.annotation.request(target, options)</code>，例如响应按钮点击。目标可以是当前文档可见区域内、已连接到 DOM 的 HTML 元素，也可以是一个 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=request-an-annotation-for-a-text-range\">DOM <code>Range</code></a>。目标无需带有批注属性。目前不支持虚拟对象 ID。</p> <p>由网站发起的请求可能需要用户授权；用户可以在 <strong>网站工具 &gt; 批注功能（Site tools &gt; Annotation features）</strong> 中重新启用被阻止的批注功能。</p> <p>本示例会针对一个没有选择属性的段落打开批注。在两个元素都创建完成后运行脚本：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;p id=\"delivery-summary\"&gt;\n  Standard delivery takes three to five business days.\n&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;button id=\"discuss-delivery\" type=\"button\" hidden&gt;Explain more&lt;/button&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const summary = document.getElementById(\"delivery-summary\");\nconst button = document.getElementById(\"discuss-delivery\");\n\nbutton.hidden = typeof document.oai?.annotation?.request !== \"function\";\n\nbutton.addEventListener(\"click\", () =&gt; {\n  const annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n  if (typeof annotation?.request !== \"function\") return;\n\n  annotation.request(summary, {\n    initialComment: \"Explain this delivery estimate.\",\n  });\n});\n</code></pre> <p>选择<strong>进一步解释（Explain more）</strong>会请求浏览器打开一条批注，将该段落设为选中对象，并预填一条可编辑评论。用户可以修改并保存评论，再将其与消息一同发送。打开批注不会向 ChatGPT 发送消息；只有用户可以提交。</p> <div id=\"try-annotation-request\"> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p>标准配送需要三个到五个工作日。</p> <p>进一步解释</p> <blockquote> <p>本地静态示意：不执行官网批注交互，按钮与画布操作在本地不可用。 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-request\">官网交互原文（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>请在当前用户交互过程中完成此调用。如果先等待网络请求，浏览器可能会丢失这次交互上下文。</p> <p>可选的第二个参数支持以下字段：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>选项</th> <th>行为</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>mode</code></td> <td>使用 <code>\"advanced\"</code> 可为元素打开高级控件；使用 <code>\"default\"</code> 则采用默认编辑器行为。默认值为 <code>\"default\"</code>。即使使用 <code>\"default\"</code>，也可以打开自定义控件，参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=choose-the-editors-default-mode\">编辑器默认模式</a>。文本范围只支持 <code>\"default\"</code>。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>enterAnnotationMode</code></td> <td>设为 <code>true</code> 可进入批注模式；即使取消或发送批注，仍会保持在该模式。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>metadata</code></td> <td>有效且非空的元数据会替换本次请求中目标元素的 HTML 元数据。文本范围请求以及目标元素位于 shadow DOM 内时，此选项会被忽略。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>initialComment</code></td> <td>提供一条可编辑评论，最多 240 个 UTF-16 代码单元。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><code>request()</code> 会返回一个包含 <code>accepted</code> 布尔值的对象。请检查 <code>result.accepted</code>，而不要直接判断返回对象本身，以确认浏览器是否已收到并验证请求。它不能证明编辑器已打开，也不能证明用户已保存或发送批注。</p> <p>编辑器加载期间，浏览器最多保留一条已接受的请求。如果已有请求等待处理、编辑器已打开，或 ChatGPT 正在控制浏览器，浏览器可能会拒绝后续请求。</p> <p><a id=\"request-an-annotation-for-a-text-range\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_6\">请求批注指定文本范围</h3> <p>传入 DOM <code>Range</code>，即可请求用户针对一段文字提供反馈，而无需更改浏览器当前的文本选区。以下示例只选择高亮显示的短语；不需要添加 <code>oai-annotation-container-text</code> 属性：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;p&gt;\n  Your trial includes full access for &lt;mark id=\"draft-passage\"&gt;14 days&lt;/mark&gt;.\n&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;button id=\"discuss-passage\" type=\"button\" hidden&gt;\n  Ask about highlighted text\n&lt;/button&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>在两个元素都创建完成后运行此脚本：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const passage = document.getElementById(\"draft-passage\");\nconst button = document.getElementById(\"discuss-passage\");\n\nbutton.hidden = typeof document.oai?.annotation?.request !== \"function\";\n\nbutton.addEventListener(\"click\", () =&gt; {\n  const annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n  if (typeof annotation?.request !== \"function\") return;\n\n  const range = document.createRange();\n  range.selectNodeContents(passage);\n  annotation.request(range, {\n    initialComment: \"Explain when this trial ends.\",\n  });\n});\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-text-range\"> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p>你的试用包含全部访问权限，有效期为 14 天。</p> <p>只为高亮显示的文字打开批注。</p> <p>询问高亮文字</p> <blockquote> <p>本地静态示意：不执行官网批注交互，按钮与画布操作在本地不可用。 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-text-range\">官网交互原文（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>范围内必须包含当前文档中可见的非空文本，且选区至少有一部分位于页面可视区域内。最多可包含 20,000 个 UTF-16 代码单元。不支持折叠范围、仅含空白字符的文本、不可见的选中文本，以及位于封闭 shadow root 中的范围。</p> <p>文本范围请求只使用默认文本编辑器。包含 <code>mode: \"advanced\"</code> 的请求会被拒绝，且请求中的元数据会被忽略。在已接受的请求等待编辑器打开期间，请保持目标文本可用：浏览器会在打开编辑器前再次检查该范围。文本选择容器则用于允许用户在批注模式下拖动选择文本。</p> <p><a id=\"choose-the-editors-default-mode\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">选择编辑器的默认模式</h2> <p>如果希望通过浏览器选择界面打开批注时立即显示高级控件，请在页面的 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> 中添加此标签：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;meta name=\"oai-annotation-editor-default-mode\" content=\"advanced\" /&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>如果从你自己的界面打开批注，请向 <code>request()</code> 传入 <code>{ mode: \"advanced\" }</code>。若要使用默认编辑器行为，请设置 <code>mode: \"default\"</code>，或省略该选项。页面的 meta 设置不会覆盖此请求选项。默认模式并不保证只打开评论编辑器：带有建议初始值的自定义控件，或省略 <code>currentValue</code> 的控件，都可能打开控件编辑器。</p> <p>手动 <strong>调整（Adjust）</strong>、折叠以及 <strong>Option 键点击（Option-click）</strong> 控件仅在 Codex 或 localhost 上可用。在 ChatGPT 中托管的网站上，已注册的自定义控件会自动显示，不会提供 <strong>调整（Adjust）</strong> 或折叠按钮。不过，页面请求的高级模式仍可使用。</p> <p><a id=\"add-custom-controls\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">添加自定义控件</h2> <p>使用 <code>registerControls()</code> 可将批注控件关联到一个或多个 DOM 元素。控件可以预览应用属性（例如间距设计令牌），也可以收集要随请求发送的选项（例如电子邮件的语气）。</p> <p><a id=\"preview-a-shared-spacing-token\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_9\">预览共用的间距令牌</h3> <p>本示例中的两张卡片使用相同的 CSS 属性。请直接在卡片上注册控件；不需要添加选择属性：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;style&gt;\n  #component-preview {\n    --card-padding: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .preview-card {\n    padding: var(--card-padding);\n    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;section id=\"component-preview\"&gt;\n  &lt;article class=\"preview-card\"&gt;Profile card&lt;/article&gt;\n  &lt;article class=\"preview-card\"&gt;Summary card&lt;/article&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>创建预览后运行此脚本：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const preview = document.getElementById(\"component-preview\");\nconst annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n\nfunction previewSpacing(event) {\n  const { callback, value } = event.detail;\n  if (callback === \"setCardPadding\") {\n    preview.style.setProperty(\"--card-padding\", `${value}px`);\n  }\n}\n\nlet registration;\nif (typeof annotation?.registerControls === \"function\") {\n  preview.addEventListener(\"oaiannotationcontrolchange\", previewSpacing);\n  registration = annotation.registerControls({\n    targets: preview.querySelectorAll(\".preview-card\"),\n    controlsHeading: \"Card spacing\",\n    controlsMode: \"replace\",\n    controls: [\n      {\n        type: \"range\",\n        label: \"Card padding (pixels)\",\n        callback: \"setCardPadding\",\n        reference: \"--card-padding\",\n        min: 8,\n        max: 32,\n        step: 4,\n        currentValue: 16,\n      },\n    ],\n  });\n}\n\nfunction disposeAnnotationControls() {\n  preview.style.removeProperty(\"--card-padding\");\n  registration?.dispose();\n  preview.removeEventListener(\"oaiannotationcontrolchange\", previewSpacing);\n}\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-spacing\"> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p><strong>卡片内边距（像素）（Card padding (pixels)）</strong></p> <p>个人资料卡片</p> <p>摘要卡片</p> <p>在批注模式下选中任意一张卡片，然后更改“卡片内边距（像素）”。必要时选择“调整”。两张卡片会同步更新。</p> <blockquote> <p>本地静态示意：不执行官网批注交互，按钮与画布操作在本地不可用。 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-spacing\">官网交互原文（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>批注任意一张卡片，并将 <strong>卡片内边距（像素）（Card padding (pixels)）</strong> 从 16 改为 24。在 ChatGPT 中托管的网站上，控件会自动显示；在 Codex 或 localhost 上，必要时请选择 <strong>调整（Adjust）</strong>。两张卡片都会同步更新。批注会记录标签、引用标识以及更改前后的值。清除预览后，原来的内边距会恢复。移除组件时，请调用 <code>disposeAnnotationControls()</code>。</p> <p><a id=\"collect-a-choice-without-a-preview\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_10\">收集选项而不预览</h3> <p>本示例为一个普通段落提供电子邮件语气选项，不需要选择属性或元数据。在段落创建完成后运行脚本：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;p id=\"email-draft\"&gt;Draft a follow-up email about the project timeline.&lt;/p&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const draft = document.getElementById(\"email-draft\");\nconst registration = document.oai?.annotation?.registerControls?.({\n  targets: draft,\n  controlsHeading: \"Email options\",\n  controlsMode: \"replace\",\n  controls: [\n    {\n      type: \"select\",\n      label: \"Email tone\",\n      callback: \"emailTone\",\n      options: [\n        { label: \"Professional\", value: \"professional\" },\n        { label: \"Friendly\", value: \"friendly\" },\n        { label: \"Direct\", value: \"direct\" },\n      ],\n      defaultValue: \"professional\",\n    },\n  ],\n});\n</code></pre> <p>此控件不会预览页面更改，因此不需要事件处理程序。省略 <code>currentValue</code> 后，即使用户保留初始选项，浏览器也会将所选语气附加到请求中。移除该段落时，请调用 <code>registration?.dispose()</code>。</p> <p>对于选择控件，预览回调收到的是 <code>option.value</code>，例如 <code>\"professional\"</code>。批注历史记录和 ChatGPT 收到的则是用户可见的 <code>option.label</code>，例如 <code>\"Professional\"</code>；之前的选项和当前选项都如此。标签应能清楚解释每个选项；<code>value</code> 中的内部 ID 不会作为选项文字发送。</p> <p><a id=\"configure-controls-and-starting-values\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_11\">配置控件与初始值</h3> <p>使用 <code>controlsMode: \"replace\"</code> 可针对已注册的目标仅显示你定义的控件；使用 <code>\"extend\"</code> 则会将它们与内置控件一起显示。可选的 <code>controlsHeading</code> 用于命名面板。浏览器会去除首尾空白，并接受长度为 1 至 80 个字符的标题。未指定标题时，面板会显示元素的 HTML 标签。此标题不会作为上下文发送给 ChatGPT。</p> <p>每个注册项最多支持 12 个控件。每个控件都必须包含 <code>type</code>、用户可见的 <code>label</code> 和 <code>callback</code> 标识符。</p> <p><strong>根据控件所更改的内容命名。</strong>请使用稳定的属性或设计用途标签，例如“页面背景（Page background）”“主品牌色（Primary brand color）”或“强调色（Accent color）”，而不是“温暖象牙白（Warm ivory）”或“深森林色（Deep forest）”这样的当前值。即使值发生变化，标签也应仍有明确含义。使用 <code>currentValue</code> 表示现有值，使用 <code>reference</code> 表示底层令牌或属性。</p> <p>例如，以下控件定义将标签与颜色分开：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const pageBackgroundControl = {\n  type: \"color\",\n  label: \"Page background\",\n  callback: \"setPageBackground\",\n  reference: \"--color-background\",\n  currentValue: \"#f6f3ec\",\n};\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-color\"> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p><strong>页面背景（Page background）</strong></p> <p>页面预览</p> <p>在批注模式下选中预览，然后更改“页面背景”。必要时选择“调整”。颜色变化时，标签仍保持不变。</p> <blockquote> <p>本地静态示意：不执行官网批注交互，按钮与画布操作在本地不可用。 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-color\">官网交互原文（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>支持的控件类型如下：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>类型</th> <th>值</th> <th>其他字段</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>color</code></td> <td>十六进制颜色，例如 <code>\"#2563eb\"</code></td> <td>无</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>range</code></td> <td>数值</td> <td><code>min</code>、<code>max</code> 和 <code>step</code></td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>select</code></td> <td>字符串</td> <td><code>options</code>，即由 <code>{ label, value }</code> 对象组成的数组</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>toggle</code></td> <td>布尔值</td> <td>无</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><code>callback</code> 是字符串标识符，而非 JavaScript 函数。在同一注册项中，该标识符必须唯一；首字符必须是 ASCII 字母，其余字符只能使用 ASCII 字母、数字、下划线或连字符。可选的 <code>reference</code> 用于标识正在更改的属性，并与标签和值一起记录在批注中。</p> <p><code>currentValue</code> 应设为该属性当前有效的常规值，包括尚未保存的编辑内容。不要将预览状态或尚未完成的输入作为基准值。浏览器会使用此值来比较更改前后的状态，以及执行重置。应用状态变化时，请使用 <code>registration.update({ controls })</code> 更新控件的 <code>currentValue</code>。更新只影响之后创建的批注；已有批注仍保留当时捕获的值。</p> <p><code>defaultValue</code> 用于设置建议的初始值；初始化控件时，它的优先级高于 <code>currentValue</code>。如果两者都省略，颜色控件初始为白色，范围控件初始为最小值，选择控件初始为第一个选项，切换控件初始为 <code>false</code>。</p> <p>请将建议值与常规草稿分开保存。如果更新抛出异常、请求失败或返回 <code>accepted: false</code>，应放弃此次建议，并恢复之前的控件和建议状态。请求被接受时则保留建议值：浏览器可能会先将请求排队，稍后才捕获控件状态。</p> <p><a id=\"validate-controls-and-registrations\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_12\">验证控件和注册项</h3> <p>浏览器会根据以下限制验证注册项及其更新：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>字段或资源</th> <th>限制</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>控件</td> <td>每个注册项最多 12 个控件，且 <code>callback</code> 标识符必须唯一。只能使用相应控件类型所定义的字段。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>标签和标题</td> <td>控件标签、选项标签和 <code>controlsHeading</code> 去除首尾空白后不得为空，且最多 80 个 UTF-16 代码单元。控件文本不能包含控制字符或更改文本方向的字符。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>标识符</td> <td><code>callback</code> 去除首尾空白后最多 80 个 UTF-16 代码单元，格式遵循上文说明。<code>reference</code> 长度为 1–80 个字符，只允许使用 ASCII 字母、数字及 <code>_ . / : @ $ # -</code>，不能包含空格。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>选择选项</td> <td>需提供 1–12 个选项，各选项的 <code>value</code> 字符串必须互不相同且不超过 512 个 UTF-16 代码单元。提供的 <code>currentValue</code> 和 <code>defaultValue</code> 必须与某个选项的值匹配。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>范围值</td> <td><code>min</code>、<code>max</code>、<code>currentValue</code> 和 <code>defaultValue</code> 必须是 −10,000 到 10,000 之间的有限数值。必须满足 <code>min &lt; max</code>；<code>step</code> 须在 0.001 到 10,000 之间，且不得大于 <code>max - min</code>；初始值必须位于范围内，但无需与 <code>step</code> 对齐。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>颜色和切换值</td> <td><code>#</code> 后的颜色代码必须包含 3、4、6 或 8 个十六进制数字。切换值必须为 <code>true</code> 或 <code>false</code>。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>目标</td> <td>注册时需提供 1–128 个目标条目，且都必须是当前文档中的元素。更新时可以传入 <code>targets: []</code> 解除关联。每个文档最多支持 64 个控件注册项，以及 1,024 个注册项与目标之间的关联。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>序列化控件数据</td> <td>包含 <code>controls</code>、<code>controlsHeading</code> 和 <code>controlsMode</code> 的 JSON 负载最多 16,384 个 UTF-16 代码单元。数据必须可编码为 JSON，不能包含函数、符号或大整数。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><code>registerControls()</code> 和 <code>registration.update()</code> 遇到无效定义、无效目标或超出限制时，可能会同步抛出异常。调用 <code>dispose()</code> 后再更新也会抛出异常。更新被拒绝时，之前的注册项（包括其控件和目标）会保持不变。请在调用位置处理错误，确保常规编辑功能仍可使用，并复用或释放自己管理的注册项，以免超出限制。</p> <p><a id=\"handle-previews-and-resets\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_13\">处理预览和重置</h3> <p><code>oaiannotationcontrolchange</code> 事件会从所选元素向上冒泡。其 <code>detail</code> 中包含 <code>callback</code>、<code>value</code> 和 <code>action</code>：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>操作</th> <th>对提供的值执行的操作</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>preview</code></td> <td>显示请求的更改。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>preview-original</code></td> <td>暂时显示原始状态以供比较。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>reset</code></td> <td>清除预览时恢复原始状态。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>与间距示例一样，应对每种操作都应用提供的值。处理程序应支持撤销，且重复调用时安全无误。预览事件并非要求永久更改；请通过应用的常规保存流程保存。应将普通草稿、未完成的输入和预览分开管理，避免无关编辑覆盖预览。用户编辑同一设置时，应替换该设置的预览，并更新后续批注使用的基准值。</p> <p>请保留注册句柄，以便更新和清理。<code>update()</code> 接受 <code>targets</code>、<code>controls</code>、<code>controlsHeading</code> 和 <code>controlsMode</code> 中的任意组合。省略的字段会保留原值。例如，替换组件的 DOM 元素时，可调用 <code>registration.update({ targets: newElement })</code>。目标集合只会记录当前已有的元素，不会跟踪之后新匹配到选择器的元素。</p> <p>传入 <code>targets: []</code> 可解除注册项与目标的关联；传入 <code>controls: []</code> 可清空其控件。移除集成时，请调用 <code>dispose()</code> 并移除事件监听器。清理过程还必须恢复常规渲染：<code>dispose()</code> 只会移除控件注册项，不会撤销你对预览所做的更改。间距示例通过移除行内覆盖样式来恢复原始 CSS 值。以上方法都会同步返回，且不返回值。更新只影响之后的选择；已保存的批注仍保留当时捕获的控件和目标。</p> <p>控件事件的目标是批注创建时捕获的元素。更新注册项的目标不会改变现有批注的目标。即使元素已被移除，仍可能会针对该元素触发重置事件，因此其原父元素上的监听器不会收到该事件。</p> <p><a id=\"make-canvas-objects-selectable\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_14\">让画布对象可供选择</h2> <p>批注表面可让你的应用识别画布中绘制的单个对象。使用 <code>registerSurface()</code> 注册宿主元素，并提供 <code>hitTest</code> 函数：命中对象时返回带有稳定 <code>id</code> 的对象；点到空白区域时返回 <code>null</code>。</p> <p>宿主必须是安全顶层文档中、位于 shadow DOM 之外且已连接的 HTML 元素。不支持在 iframe 内注册表面。</p> <p><a id=\"start-with-picking-and-identity\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_15\">从对象拾取和身份标识开始</h3> <p>本示例会绘制一根收入柱，仅通过 <code>hitTest</code> 和稳定的对象 ID 使其可供选择。请将脚本放在画布之后：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;canvas id=\"revenue-canvas\" width=\"480\" height=\"240\"&gt;\n  Revenue this quarter: $120,000.\n&lt;/canvas&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const canvas = document.getElementById(\"revenue-canvas\");\nconst context = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\nconst bar = { x: 40, y: 60, width: 320, height: 100 };\n\ncontext.fillStyle = \"#2563eb\";\ncontext.fillRect(bar.x, bar.y, bar.width, bar.height);\n\nconst surface = document.oai?.annotation?.registerSurface?.({\n  element: canvas,\n  hitTest({ clientX, clientY }) {\n    const bounds = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const scaleX = bounds.width / canvas.width;\n    const scaleY = bounds.height / canvas.height;\n    const rect = {\n      x: bounds.left + bar.x * scaleX,\n      y: bounds.top + bar.y * scaleY,\n      width: bar.width * scaleX,\n      height: bar.height * scaleY,\n    };\n\n    if (\n      clientX &lt; rect.x ||\n      clientX &gt; rect.x + rect.width ||\n      clientY &lt; rect.y ||\n      clientY &gt; rect.y + rect.height\n    ) {\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    return { id: \"revenue-this-quarter\" };\n  },\n});\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-canvas\"> <p><strong>动手试试</strong></p> <p>圆形</p> <p>三角形</p> <p>正方形</p> <p>星形</p> <p>进入批注模式，然后选中一个形状，即可在批注中查看其名称、ID 和填充颜色。形状之间的空白区域不可选择。</p> <blockquote> <p>本地静态示意：不执行官网批注交互，按钮与画布操作在本地不可用。 <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-canvas\">官网交互原文（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>在此代码示例中，在批注模式下选中柱形会将其识别为 <code>revenue-this-quarter</code>。同一表面中的 ID 应保持稳定。本示例在空白区域返回 <code>null</code>。</p> <p><code>hitTest</code> 可以返回 Promise，并会通过 <code>signal</code> 参数接收一个 <code>AbortSignal</code>，以取消已被新请求取代的工作。浏览器最多等待 250 毫秒，之后会回退到 DOM 选择。发生错误或返回无效结果时也会回退。命中测试成功但未找到对象时，请明确返回 <code>null</code>。</p> <p>即使工作已取消，仍必须让对应的 Promise 成功兑现或失败拒绝。浏览器同一时间只允许一个 <code>hitTest</code> 回调执行；即使请求已取消或超时，也会一直占用该位置，直到 Promise 完成。如果由 worker 执行命中检测，在工作被中止时也要结束待处理的 Promise；丢弃已取消的 worker 响应可能会阻止后续画布选择。</p> <p>移动对象或更改缩放级别后调用 <code>surface?.invalidate()</code>；移除集成时调用 <code>surface?.dispose()</code>。这两个方法都会同步返回，且不返回值。</p> <p><a id=\"add-optional-object-context\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_16\">添加可选的对象上下文</h3> <p><code>id</code> 已足以标识对象。若要包含显示名称、语义角色、隐藏上下文或选中范围，请将上一个 <code>hitTest</code> 回调中命中对象时的返回语句替换为：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">return {\n  id: \"revenue-this-quarter\",\n  name: \"Revenue this quarter\",\n  role: \"chart-bar\",\n  metadata: { metricId: \"quarterly-revenue\" },\n  rect,\n};\n</code></pre> <p>可选的 <code>name</code> 会展示给用户；<code>role</code> 用于提供简短的语义描述。只有在需要补充页面上尚不可见的上下文时，才加入元数据。可选的 <code>rect</code> 使用相对于页面可视区域的 CSS 像素，与 <code>clientX</code> 和 <code>clientY</code> 的坐标系一致。拾取示例已计算出这个矩形。请将场景坐标转换为该坐标系，并考虑缩放比例、平移和缩放级别。</p> <p><a id=\"add-optional-selection-feedback\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_17\">添加可选的选择反馈</h3> <p>使用可选的 <code>renderSelection</code> 回调，可以绘制自定义的悬停和选择反馈。此功能不依赖可选的上下文字段。</p> <p>对于上面的画布，请定义以下函数，并在 <code>registerSurface()</code> 选项中加入 <code>renderSelection: renderRevenueSelection</code>：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">function renderRevenueSelection({ hoveredId, selectedId }) {\n  context.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n  context.fillStyle = \"#2563eb\";\n  context.fillRect(bar.x, bar.y, bar.width, bar.height);\n\n  if (\n    hoveredId === \"revenue-this-quarter\" ||\n    selectedId === \"revenue-this-quarter\"\n  ) {\n    context.strokeStyle = \"#111827\";\n    context.lineWidth = 3;\n    context.strokeRect(bar.x, bar.y, bar.width, bar.height);\n  }\n}\n</code></pre> <p>此回调会重新绘制柱形，并在悬停或选中时添加轮廓。当两个 ID 都为 <code>null</code> 时，会重新绘制不带轮廓的柱形。</p> <p><a id=\"add-controls-to-canvas-objects\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_18\">为画布对象添加控件</h3> <p>请在表面的 DOM 元素上注册自定义控件。API 将绘制对象称为“虚拟对象”；虚拟对象使用你的自定义控件，不适用内置的 CSS 和文本控件。</p> <p>对于多个对象，请在 <code>selectedId</code> 变化时使用 <code>renderSelection</code> 更新宿主控件，并确保在浏览器捕获批注前完成。控件事件中会包含 <code>detail.virtualTarget: { surfaceId, targetId }</code>。请根据已捕获的身份信息和对应的 <code>callback</code> 分派各事件，不要根据当前选中项分派。<code>targetId</code> 与 <code>hitTest</code> 返回的 <code>id</code> 一致；<code>surfaceId</code> 用于标识浏览器中的表面注册项。普通 DOM 事件不包含 <code>virtualTarget</code>。</p> <p>即使之后选中了其他对象，预览、比较和重置事件仍会保留原对象的身份信息。重新打开已保存的批注时，不会重新执行命中检测来替换已捕获的对象或元数据。</p> <p><a id=\"control-annotation-mode\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_19\">控制批注模式</h2> <p>使用 <code>toggle()</code> 请求更改模式，使用 <code>isActive()</code> 读取已确认的状态，并监听文档的 <code>oaiannotationmodechange</code> 事件以同步更新界面。为了兼容较旧或不支持此功能的浏览器，请检测这两个方法是否存在。添加以下按钮，并在按钮创建后运行脚本：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;button id=\"toggle-annotations\" type=\"button\" hidden&gt;\n  Enter annotation mode\n&lt;/button&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const button = document.getElementById(\"toggle-annotations\");\nconst annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n\nfunction renderMode(active) {\n  button.textContent = active\n    ? \"Exit annotation mode\"\n    : \"Enter annotation mode\";\n}\n\nconst onModeChange = (event) =&gt; renderMode(event.detail.active);\nconst onClick = () =&gt; annotation.toggle(!annotation.isActive());\n\nif (\n  typeof annotation?.toggle === \"function\" &amp;&amp;\n  typeof annotation?.isActive === \"function\"\n) {\n  document.addEventListener(\"oaiannotationmodechange\", onModeChange);\n  button.addEventListener(\"click\", onClick);\n  renderMode(annotation.isActive());\n  button.hidden = false;\n}\n\nfunction cleanupAnnotationButton() {\n  document.removeEventListener(\"oaiannotationmodechange\", onModeChange);\n  button.removeEventListener(\"click\", onClick);\n  button.hidden = true;\n}\n</code></pre> <p><code>toggle()</code> 会反转当前模式。传入 <code>true</code> 可确保模式已开启，传入 <code>false</code> 则可确保模式已关闭。多次传入相同布尔值的请求具有幂等性。传入 <code>true</code> 会保留已打开的编辑器或等待处理的启用请求；传入 <code>false</code> 会取消等待处理的启用请求，并按常规流程退出。</p> <p><code>toggle()</code> 应由当前正在进行的用户交互触发。它同步返回的 <code>{ accepted }</code> 结果仅表示请求已受理，并不代表模式已确认切换。浏览器的资格检查仍可能阻止切换。请像示例中那样，通过 <code>isActive()</code> 和事件读取状态。</p> <p><code>isActive()</code> 不需要用户手势。浏览器会先更新其状态，再派发 <code>oaiannotationmodechange</code>；事件中的 <code>event.detail.active</code> 是布尔值。浏览器不会发送初始事件，也不会针对被强制设为原状态的操作重复发送事件，因此应通过该读取方法初始化界面。如果模式开启期间访问权限被撤销，最后一个事件会报告 <code>active: false</code>，之后保留的读取方法也会返回 <code>false</code>。</p> <p>批注模式会拦截页面点击。按住 <strong>Space</strong> 才能使用页面控件（包括退出按钮）；也可以通过浏览器的批注界面退出。仅按住 <strong>Space</strong> 不会使 <code>isActive()</code> 变为 false。此 API 不支持 <code>oai-annotation-ignore</code> 或其他可让点击事件穿透的属性。</p> <p>退出时会关闭编辑器，并保留已保存的批注；不会提交批注，也不会将其移入消息撰写框。移除组件时，请调用 <code>cleanupAnnotationButton()</code>。即使 API 命名空间已消失，已捕获的 API 引用仍可供清理逻辑移除监听器。</p> <p><a id=\"test-your-integration\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_20\">测试你的集成</h2> <p>在桌面应用的内置浏览器中打开你的网站，并测试已添加的功能：</p> <ol> <li>进入批注模式并选择对象和文本，检查高亮、名称、范围和元数据是否与预期目标一致。</li> <li>通过网站上的按钮打开批注，检查选中的元素或文本范围、初始评论和编辑器模式。</li> <li>更改自定义控件，与原始状态比较，然后清除预览；确认应用已恢复原始状态。</li> <li>对画布内容测试空白区域、大小调整和场景变化。切换对象，确认控件事件仍会更新已捕获的目标。取消一次异步命中检测，再确认之后仍可正常选择对象。</li> <li>从消息撰写框的附件预览中保存、重新打开并编辑批注。确认批注仍保留其控件和目标，移除相关组件后预览也会清除。</li> <li>随消息发送一条批注。确认 ChatGPT 收到选中内容、元数据和请求的值；这包括用户可见的选择标签，以及省略 <code>currentValue</code> 的控件中未更改的选项。</li> <li>在不支持此 API 的浏览器中打开网站，确认常规交互仍可使用。</li> </ol> <p>如需向 ChatGPT 提供可在网站上执行的操作，请添加 <a href=\"#/article/a-d8e7ab2e8f18b498\">Site tools (WebMCP)</a>。批注会将用户的选中内容和反馈带入对话；Site tools 则允许智能体利用应用现有功能，根据这些上下文执行操作。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"annotations-extensibility\">Annotations Extensibility</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>The Browser Annotation API lets your website customize what people select, what context accompanies their feedback, and which controls they use to preview changes before sending an annotation to ChatGPT.</p> <p>In ChatGPT Enterprise and Edu workspaces, an admin must allow <strong>Site annotation customizations</strong> through workspace policy.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-comment-on-the-page\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Browser annotations (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Local page (section not recognized)</a> work on your site without any code changes. People can select part of a page, add a comment, and send it in Context to Codex or ChatGPT Work.</p> <p>As a developer, you can use the Browser Annotation API to provide context or controls specific to your application. For example, you can attach previews for component variants in a design system preview for developers to know how to update the components on a website.</p> <p>To get help understanding the Browser Annotation API or adding annotation support to your website, install the Annotations Extensibility plugin.</p> <p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/plugins/Plugin_94f13f4285908191bb882d31b1ffc59e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Install the Annotations Extensibility plugin (online)</a></p> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p>See the Browser Annotation API in action on this guide.</p> <ol> <li>Open this page in ChatGPT's built-in browser.</li> <li>Try opening the suggested prompt that will appear in this card.</li> <li>Enter <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809?sectionMissing=app-comment-on-the-page\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Annotation mode (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Local page (section not recognized)</a>, then select the table below or a code sample to switch between predefined layouts and themes.</li> <li>You can still annotate any item on the page and see default annotation behavior.</li> </ol> <p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/codex/deeplink?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.chatgpt.com%2Fdocs%2Fannotations-extensibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in ChatGPT's browser (online)</a></p> <h2 id=\"choose-what-to-customize\">Choose what to customize</h2> <p>Start with the integration that fits your website:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Goal</th> <th>Integration</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Make a card or other group of elements selectable as one object</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=customize-selection-targets\">Selection targets</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Let people select a phrase or sentence</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=enable-text-selection\">Text selection containers</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Include additional context with a selection</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=add-context-to-a-selection\">Selection metadata</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Open an annotation from your own button with a suggested comment</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=open-an-annotation-from-your-website\">Annotation requests</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Request feedback on an exact passage from your own UI</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=request-an-annotation-for-a-text-range\">Text-range requests</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Show advanced controls when an annotation opens</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=choose-the-editors-default-mode\">Editor defaults</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Preview application properties or collect choices</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=add-custom-controls\">Custom controls</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Select individual objects drawn inside a canvas</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=make-canvas-objects-selectable\">Annotation surfaces</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Turn Annotation mode on or off from your site</td> <td><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=control-annotation-mode\">Annotation mode controls</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>This guide targets the DevDay 2026 release of the ChatGPT desktop app and later. The JavaScript API is available through <code>document.oai.annotation</code> in the app's built-in browser, on secure, top-level pages such as HTTPS or localhost. When enabled, the browser installs it before your page's scripts run. Feature-detect each method to support older or unsupported browsers, then initialize your integration once its DOM elements exist. No readiness event or polling is needed.</p> <p>API methods return synchronously, and registration handles are ready to use immediately. The browser can finish loading the annotation editor afterward. A surface's <code>hitTest</code> callback can return a promise.</p> <h2 id=\"customize-selection-targets\">Customize selection targets</h2> <p>By default, Annotation mode selects elements from the page's DOM, favoring targets such as text, images, and controls. To make a larger object selectable, mark its containing region with <code>oai-annotation-container</code> and its selectable descendants with <code>oai-annotatable</code>.</p> <p>This example makes a chart card selectable as one object:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;section oai-annotation-container&gt;\n  &lt;article id=\"chart-card\" oai-annotatable=\"Q3 Revenue\"&gt;\n    &lt;h2&gt;Q3 Revenue&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;$120,000 this quarter&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;button type=\"button\"&gt;More info&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/article&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>Pointing anywhere within the card highlights the entire card. The optional <code>oai-annotatable</code> value gives the object a name shown to the user and the model. Choose names that distinguish nearby objects, or omit the value.</p> <p>The container defines where these selection rules apply. An <code>oai-annotatable</code> attribute on its own doesn't change selection behavior. Within a container, the browser selects the nearest marked target containing the element under the pointer. Nested containers use the nearest container. Unmarked areas inside a container create a webpage annotation; areas outside all containers keep the default behavior.</p> <h2 id=\"enable-text-selection\">Enable text selection</h2> <p>Add <code>oai-annotation-container-text</code> to a region to let people drag to select text during Annotation mode. The attribute doesn't need a value:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;article oai-annotation-container-text&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Design guidelines&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Use consistent spacing between related components.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Leave more space between separate groups.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/article&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>Releasing a nonempty selection opens the text annotation editor with the selected range and its context. Clicking without selecting text doesn't create an annotation. <strong>Escape</strong> or a canceled gesture cancels the selection.</p> <p>The nearest text or DOM selection container determines how a gesture begins. Text containers don't use <code>oai-annotatable</code> markers for element picking. Nest an <code>oai-annotation-container</code> to restore element picking, or a text container to restore text selection. If both attributes are on one element, text selection takes precedence.</p> <p>Text selection follows the page's normal selection rules and can extend beyond the starting container. A container doesn't clip the range or enable selection inside an iframe. Text fields remain selectable, but ordinary page clicks and native actions on controls remain blocked during Annotation mode. Explicit <code>request()</code> calls keep their existing behavior.</p> <p>Text selection containers take effect only during Annotation mode when the site annotation capability and per-site setting are enabled.</p> <h2 id=\"add-context-to-a-selection\">Add context to a selection</h2> <p>Add <code>oai-annotation-metadata</code> to a marked target to include context that may not be visible on the page. For example, a fictional contact row can include an email address for a request to draft an email:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;section oai-annotation-container&gt;\n  &lt;div\n    id=\"contact-row\"\n    oai-annotatable=\"Alex Morgan\"\n    oai-annotation-metadata='{\"email\":\"alex@example.com\"}'\n  &gt;\n    &lt;div&gt;Alex Morgan&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div&gt;Project lead&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-metadata\"> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p><strong>Alex Morgan</strong></p> <p>Project lead</p> <p>Select the contact in Annotation mode to see the email address included as context.</p> <blockquote> <p>Static local illustration: official annotation interactions, buttons, and canvas actions are not available locally. <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-metadata\">Official interactive documentation (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>Selecting either line selects the entire row. The metadata appears with the annotation and accompanies it in the conversation. Include only context you intend to share with both the user and the model. Sending an email would still require a connected email tool.</p> <p>Use a small, flat JSON object with these limits:</p> <ul> <li>Up to six properties, with string, finite number, boolean, or <code>null</code> values.</li> <li>Keys up to 64 characters and string values up to 256 characters.</li> <li>Up to 2,048 bytes for the serialized object.</li> </ul> <p>Keys must start with an ASCII letter and contain only ASCII letters, digits, spaces, underscores, or hyphens. Use single spaces between words. Nested objects and arrays aren't supported. The browser ignores invalid metadata.</p> <p>You can also provide metadata through <code>request()</code> or a surface's <code>hitTest</code> result.</p> <h2 id=\"open-an-annotation-from-your-website\">Open an annotation from your website</h2> <p>Call <code>document.oai.annotation.request(target, options)</code> directly from a user interaction, such as a button press. The target can be a connected HTML element within the visible area of the current document or a <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=request-an-annotation-for-a-text-range\">DOM <code>Range</code></a>. It doesn't need annotation attributes. Virtual object IDs aren't supported.</p> <p>Site-initiated requests may require user permission; users can re-enable blocked annotation features under <strong>Site tools &gt; Annotation features</strong>.</p> <p>This example opens an annotation on a paragraph without selection attributes. Run the script after both elements exist:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;p id=\"delivery-summary\"&gt;\n  Standard delivery takes three to five business days.\n&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;button id=\"discuss-delivery\" type=\"button\" hidden&gt;Explain more&lt;/button&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const summary = document.getElementById(\"delivery-summary\");\nconst button = document.getElementById(\"discuss-delivery\");\n\nbutton.hidden = typeof document.oai?.annotation?.request !== \"function\";\n\nbutton.addEventListener(\"click\", () =&gt; {\n  const annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n  if (typeof annotation?.request !== \"function\") return;\n\n  annotation.request(summary, {\n    initialComment: \"Explain this delivery estimate.\",\n  });\n});\n</code></pre> <p>Selecting <strong>Explain more</strong> asks the browser to open an annotation with the paragraph selected and an editable comment. The person can edit, save, and send it with their message. Opening an annotation doesn't send a message to ChatGPT; only the user can submit it.</p> <div id=\"try-annotation-request\"> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p>Standard delivery takes three to five business days.</p> <p>Explain more</p> <blockquote> <p>Static local illustration: official annotation interactions, buttons, and canvas actions are not available locally. <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-request\">Official interactive documentation (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>Keep the call within the active user interaction. Awaiting a network request first can lose that interaction.</p> <p>The optional second argument supports these fields:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Option</th> <th>Behavior</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>mode</code></td> <td>Use <code>\"advanced\"</code> to open advanced controls for an element, or <code>\"default\"</code> to use the default editor behavior. Defaults to <code>\"default\"</code>. Custom controls can still open with <code>\"default\"</code>; see <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=choose-the-editors-default-mode\">Editor defaults</a>. Text ranges support only <code>\"default\"</code>.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>enterAnnotationMode</code></td> <td>Set to <code>true</code> to enter Annotation mode and remain in it after canceling or sending the annotation.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>metadata</code></td> <td>Valid, nonempty metadata replaces the target's HTML metadata for this request. This option is ignored for text ranges and when the target element is inside a shadow DOM.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>initialComment</code></td> <td>Supplies an editable comment, up to 240 UTF-16 code units.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><code>request()</code> returns an object with an <code>accepted</code> boolean. Check <code>result.accepted</code>, not the result object, to see whether the browser received and validated the request. It doesn't confirm that the editor opened or that the person saved or sent an annotation.</p> <p>While the editor loads, the browser can hold one accepted request. It can decline another while a request is pending, an editor is open, or ChatGPT is controlling the browser.</p> <h3 id=\"request-an-annotation-for-a-text-range\">Request an annotation for a text range</h3> <p>Pass a DOM <code>Range</code> to request feedback on a passage without changing the browser's text selection. This example selects only the highlighted phrase; it doesn't need an <code>oai-annotation-container-text</code> attribute:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;p&gt;\n  Your trial includes full access for &lt;mark id=\"draft-passage\"&gt;14 days&lt;/mark&gt;.\n&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;button id=\"discuss-passage\" type=\"button\" hidden&gt;\n  Ask about highlighted text\n&lt;/button&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>Run this script after both elements exist:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const passage = document.getElementById(\"draft-passage\");\nconst button = document.getElementById(\"discuss-passage\");\n\nbutton.hidden = typeof document.oai?.annotation?.request !== \"function\";\n\nbutton.addEventListener(\"click\", () =&gt; {\n  const annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n  if (typeof annotation?.request !== \"function\") return;\n\n  const range = document.createRange();\n  range.selectNodeContents(passage);\n  annotation.request(range, {\n    initialComment: \"Explain when this trial ends.\",\n  });\n});\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-text-range\"> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p>Your trial includes full access for 14 days.</p> <p>Open an annotation on just the highlighted words.</p> <p>Ask about highlighted text</p> <blockquote> <p>Static local illustration: official annotation interactions, buttons, and canvas actions are not available locally. <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-text-range\">Official interactive documentation (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>The range must contain nonempty visible text in the current document, with at least part of the selection in the visible page area. It can contain at most 20,000 UTF-16 code units. Collapsed ranges, whitespace-only text, hidden selected text, and ranges in closed shadow roots aren't supported.</p> <p>Text-range requests use only the default text editor. A request with <code>mode: \"advanced\"</code> is rejected, and request metadata is ignored. Keep the target text available while an accepted request waits for the editor: the browser checks the range again before opening it. Text selection containers separately enable people to drag to select text during Annotation mode.</p> <h2 id=\"choose-the-editors-default-mode\">Choose the editor's default mode</h2> <p>To show advanced controls immediately for annotations opened through the browser's selection UI, add this tag to your page's <code>&lt;head&gt;</code>:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;meta name=\"oai-annotation-editor-default-mode\" content=\"advanced\" /&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>For annotations opened from your own UI, pass <code>{ mode: \"advanced\" }</code> to <code>request()</code>. Use <code>mode: \"default\"</code>, or omit it, for the default editor behavior. The page's meta setting doesn't override this request option. Default mode doesn't guarantee a comment-only editor: custom controls with proposed starting values, or controls that omit <code>currentValue</code>, can open the controls editor.</p> <p>Manual <strong>Adjust</strong>, collapse, and <strong>Option-click</strong> controls are available only in Codex or on localhost. On hosted sites in ChatGPT, registered custom controls appear automatically without an <strong>Adjust</strong> or collapse button. Page-requested advanced mode still works there.</p> <h2 id=\"add-custom-controls\">Add custom controls</h2> <p>Use <code>registerControls()</code> to associate annotation controls with one or more DOM elements. Controls can preview application properties, such as a spacing token, or collect choices to include with a request, such as an email tone.</p> <h3 id=\"preview-a-shared-spacing-token\">Preview a shared spacing token</h3> <p>Both cards in this example use the same CSS property. Register the controls on the cards directly; selection attributes aren't required:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;style&gt;\n  #component-preview {\n    --card-padding: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .preview-card {\n    padding: var(--card-padding);\n    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;section id=\"component-preview\"&gt;\n  &lt;article class=\"preview-card\"&gt;Profile card&lt;/article&gt;\n  &lt;article class=\"preview-card\"&gt;Summary card&lt;/article&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>Run this script after creating the preview:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const preview = document.getElementById(\"component-preview\");\nconst annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n\nfunction previewSpacing(event) {\n  const { callback, value } = event.detail;\n  if (callback === \"setCardPadding\") {\n    preview.style.setProperty(\"--card-padding\", `${value}px`);\n  }\n}\n\nlet registration;\nif (typeof annotation?.registerControls === \"function\") {\n  preview.addEventListener(\"oaiannotationcontrolchange\", previewSpacing);\n  registration = annotation.registerControls({\n    targets: preview.querySelectorAll(\".preview-card\"),\n    controlsHeading: \"Card spacing\",\n    controlsMode: \"replace\",\n    controls: [\n      {\n        type: \"range\",\n        label: \"Card padding (pixels)\",\n        callback: \"setCardPadding\",\n        reference: \"--card-padding\",\n        min: 8,\n        max: 32,\n        step: 4,\n        currentValue: 16,\n      },\n    ],\n  });\n}\n\nfunction disposeAnnotationControls() {\n  preview.style.removeProperty(\"--card-padding\");\n  registration?.dispose();\n  preview.removeEventListener(\"oaiannotationcontrolchange\", previewSpacing);\n}\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-spacing\"> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p><strong>Card padding (pixels)</strong></p> <p>Profile card</p> <p>Summary card</p> <p>Select either card in Annotation mode, then change Card padding (pixels). Select Adjust if needed. Both cards update together.</p> <blockquote> <p>Static local illustration: official annotation interactions, buttons, and canvas actions are not available locally. <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-spacing\">Official interactive documentation (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>Annotate either card and change <strong>Card padding (pixels)</strong> from 16 to 24. On hosted sites in ChatGPT, the controls appear automatically; in Codex or on localhost, select <strong>Adjust</strong> if needed. Both cards update. The annotation records the label, reference, and old and new values. Clearing the preview restores the original padding. Call <code>disposeAnnotationControls()</code> when removing the component.</p> <h3 id=\"collect-a-choice-without-a-preview\">Collect a choice without a preview</h3> <p>This example offers an email tone for a plain paragraph. It doesn't need selection attributes or metadata. Run the script after the paragraph exists:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;p id=\"email-draft\"&gt;Draft a follow-up email about the project timeline.&lt;/p&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const draft = document.getElementById(\"email-draft\");\nconst registration = document.oai?.annotation?.registerControls?.({\n  targets: draft,\n  controlsHeading: \"Email options\",\n  controlsMode: \"replace\",\n  controls: [\n    {\n      type: \"select\",\n      label: \"Email tone\",\n      callback: \"emailTone\",\n      options: [\n        { label: \"Professional\", value: \"professional\" },\n        { label: \"Friendly\", value: \"friendly\" },\n        { label: \"Direct\", value: \"direct\" },\n      ],\n      defaultValue: \"professional\",\n    },\n  ],\n});\n</code></pre> <p>This control doesn't need an event handler because it doesn't preview a page change. Omitting <code>currentValue</code> tells the browser to include the selected tone even if the user keeps the initial option. Call <code>registration?.dispose()</code> when removing the paragraph.</p> <p>For select controls, preview callbacks receive <code>option.value</code>, such as <code>\"professional\"</code>. Annotation history and ChatGPT receive the visible <code>option.label</code>, such as <code>\"Professional\"</code>, for both the previous and selected options. Use labels that explain each choice; internal IDs in <code>value</code> aren't sent as the choice's text.</p> <h3 id=\"configure-controls-and-starting-values\">Configure controls and starting values</h3> <p>Use <code>controlsMode: \"replace\"</code> to show only your controls for the registered targets, or <code>\"extend\"</code> to show them alongside built-in controls. An optional <code>controlsHeading</code> names the panel. The browser trims it and accepts one to 80 characters. Without a heading, the panel shows the element's HTML tag. The heading isn't included in the context sent to ChatGPT.</p> <p>A registration supports up to 12 controls. Each requires a <code>type</code>, visible <code>label</code>, and <code>callback</code> identifier.</p> <p><strong>Name controls by what they change.</strong> Use a stable property or design-role label, such as \"Page background,\" \"Primary brand color,\" or \"Accent color,\" rather than the current value, such as \"Warm ivory\" or \"Deep forest.\" The label should remain meaningful when the value changes. Use <code>currentValue</code> for the existing value and <code>reference</code> for the underlying token or property.</p> <p>For example, this control definition keeps the label separate from the color:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const pageBackgroundControl = {\n  type: \"color\",\n  label: \"Page background\",\n  callback: \"setPageBackground\",\n  reference: \"--color-background\",\n  currentValue: \"#f6f3ec\",\n};\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-color\"> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p><strong>Page background</strong></p> <p>Page preview</p> <p>Select the preview in Annotation mode, then change Page background. Select Adjust if needed. The label stays the same as the color changes.</p> <blockquote> <p>Static local illustration: official annotation interactions, buttons, and canvas actions are not available locally. <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-color\">Official interactive documentation (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>The supported control types are:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Type</th> <th>Value</th> <th>Additional fields</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>color</code></td> <td>Hex color, such as <code>\"#2563eb\"</code></td> <td>None</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>range</code></td> <td>Number</td> <td><code>min</code>, <code>max</code>, and <code>step</code></td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>select</code></td> <td>String</td> <td><code>options</code>, an array of <code>{ label, value }</code> objects</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>toggle</code></td> <td>boolean</td> <td>None</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><code>callback</code> is a string identifier, not a JavaScript function. Make it unique within the registration, start it with an ASCII letter, and use ASCII letters, digits, underscores, or hyphens. An optional <code>reference</code> identifies the property being changed and accompanies the label and value in the annotation.</p> <p>Set <code>currentValue</code> to the property's valid ordinary value, including unsaved edits. Don't use preview state or unfinished input as the baseline. The browser uses it for before-and-after changes and resets. When application state changes, use <code>registration.update({ controls })</code> to refresh the controls' <code>currentValue</code> values. Updates affect future annotations; existing annotations retain their captured values.</p> <p>Set <code>defaultValue</code> for a suggested starting value; it takes precedence over <code>currentValue</code> for the initial control state. If you omit both, the control starts with white for a color, the minimum for a range, the first option for a select, or <code>false</code> for a toggle.</p> <p>Keep proposed values separate from ordinary drafts. If an update throws or a request fails or returns <code>accepted: false</code>, discard the attempted proposal and restore the prior controls and proposal state. Retain proposals when a request is accepted: the browser may queue it before capturing the controls.</p> <h3 id=\"validate-controls-and-registrations\">Validate controls and registrations</h3> <p>The browser validates registrations and updates against these limits:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Field or resource</th> <th>Constraint</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Controls</td> <td>Up to 12 per registration, with unique <code>callback</code> identifiers. Use only the fields defined for the control type.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Labels and headings</td> <td>Control labels, option labels, and <code>controlsHeading</code> must be nonempty after trimming and at most 80 UTF-16 code units. Control text can't contain control characters or direction-changing characters.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Identifiers</td> <td><code>callback</code> is at most 80 UTF-16 code units after trimming, using the format described above. <code>reference</code> is 1–80 characters and allows ASCII letters, digits, and <code>_ . / : @ $ # -</code>, without spaces.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Select options</td> <td>1–12 options with distinct <code>value</code> strings of at most 512 UTF-16 code units. Supplied <code>currentValue</code> and <code>defaultValue</code> must match an option's value.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Range values</td> <td><code>min</code>, <code>max</code>, <code>currentValue</code>, and <code>defaultValue</code> must be finite numbers between −10,000 and 10,000. Require <code>min &lt; max</code>, a <code>step</code> from 0.001 to 10,000 that is no larger than <code>max - min</code>, and starting values within the range. Starting values don't have to align with <code>step</code>.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Colors and toggles</td> <td>Colors must use 3, 4, 6, or 8 hexadecimal digits after <code>#</code>. Toggle values must be <code>true</code> or <code>false</code>.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Targets</td> <td>1–128 target entries when registering, all elements in the current document. Updates can pass <code>targets: []</code> to detach. Each document supports up to 64 controls registrations and 1,024 registration-to-target associations.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Serialized controls</td> <td>The JSON payload containing <code>controls</code>, <code>controlsHeading</code>, and <code>controlsMode</code> must fit within 16,384 UTF-16 code units. Use data that can be encoded as JSON, without functions, symbols, or big integers.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><code>registerControls()</code> and <code>registration.update()</code> can throw synchronously for invalid definitions, targets, or exceeded limits. An update after <code>dispose()</code> also throws. A rejected update preserves the previous registration, including its controls and targets. Handle failures at the call site, keep ordinary editing usable, and reuse or dispose of owned registrations to stay within the limits.</p> <h3 id=\"handle-previews-and-resets\">Handle previews and resets</h3> <p>The <code>oaiannotationcontrolchange</code> event bubbles from the selected element. Its <code>detail</code> contains <code>callback</code>, <code>value</code>, and <code>action</code>:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Action</th> <th>Apply the supplied value to</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>preview</code></td> <td>Show the requested change.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>preview-original</code></td> <td>Temporarily show the original state for comparison.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>reset</code></td> <td>Restore the original state when the preview is cleared.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Apply the supplied value for every action, as the spacing example does. Make handlers reversible and safe to call repeatedly. Preview events don't request a permanent change; save through your application's normal save flow. Keep ordinary drafts, unfinished input, and previews separate so unrelated edits don't overwrite a preview. When someone edits the same setting, replace its preview and update the baseline for future annotations.</p> <p>Keep the registration handle for updates and cleanup. <code>update()</code> accepts any combination of <code>targets</code>, <code>controls</code>, <code>controlsHeading</code>, and <code>controlsMode</code>. Omitted fields keep their previous values. For example, use <code>registration.update({ targets: newElement })</code> when replacing a component's DOM element. Target collections capture existing elements and don't track future selector matches.</p> <p>Pass <code>targets: []</code> to detach the registration or <code>controls: []</code> to clear its controls. Call <code>dispose()</code> and remove event listeners when removing the integration. Cleanup must also restore ordinary rendering: <code>dispose()</code> only removes the controls registration and doesn't undo your preview changes. The spacing example removes its inline override to restore the original CSS value. Both methods return synchronously without a value. Updates affect future selections; saved annotations retain their captured controls and target.</p> <p>Control events target the element captured by the annotation. Updating a registration's targets does not redirect existing annotations. Reset events can still fire on a removed element, so a listener on its former parent will not receive them.</p> <h2 id=\"make-canvas-objects-selectable\">Make canvas objects selectable</h2> <p>An annotation surface lets your application identify individual objects drawn inside a canvas. Register the host element with <code>registerSurface()</code> and provide a <code>hitTest</code> function that returns an object with a stable <code>id</code>, or <code>null</code> for empty space.</p> <p>The host must be a connected HTML element outside shadow DOM in a secure, top-level document. Surface registration isn't supported inside an iframe.</p> <h3 id=\"start-with-picking-and-identity\">Start with picking and identity</h3> <p>This example draws a revenue bar and makes it selectable using only <code>hitTest</code> and a stable object ID. Put the script after the canvas:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;canvas id=\"revenue-canvas\" width=\"480\" height=\"240\"&gt;\n  Revenue this quarter: $120,000.\n&lt;/canvas&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const canvas = document.getElementById(\"revenue-canvas\");\nconst context = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\nconst bar = { x: 40, y: 60, width: 320, height: 100 };\n\ncontext.fillStyle = \"#2563eb\";\ncontext.fillRect(bar.x, bar.y, bar.width, bar.height);\n\nconst surface = document.oai?.annotation?.registerSurface?.({\n  element: canvas,\n  hitTest({ clientX, clientY }) {\n    const bounds = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const scaleX = bounds.width / canvas.width;\n    const scaleY = bounds.height / canvas.height;\n    const rect = {\n      x: bounds.left + bar.x * scaleX,\n      y: bounds.top + bar.y * scaleY,\n      width: bar.width * scaleX,\n      height: bar.height * scaleY,\n    };\n\n    if (\n      clientX &lt; rect.x ||\n      clientX &gt; rect.x + rect.width ||\n      clientY &lt; rect.y ||\n      clientY &gt; rect.y + rect.height\n    ) {\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    return { id: \"revenue-this-quarter\" };\n  },\n});\n</code></pre> <div id=\"try-annotation-canvas\"> <p><strong>Try it</strong></p> <p>Circle</p> <p>Triangle</p> <p>Square</p> <p>Star</p> <p>Enter Annotation mode, then select a shape to see its name, ID, and fill color in the annotation. The space between shapes is not selectable.</p> <blockquote> <p>Static local illustration: official annotation interactions, buttons, and canvas actions are not available locally. <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d?anchor=try-annotation-canvas\">Official interactive documentation (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Local page (section not recognized)</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>In the code sample, selecting the bar in Annotation mode identifies it as <code>revenue-this-quarter</code>. Keep IDs stable within a surface. The example returns <code>null</code> for empty space.</p> <p><code>hitTest</code> can return a promise and receives an <code>AbortSignal</code> as <code>signal</code> to cancel superseded work. The browser allows 250 milliseconds before falling back to DOM selection. Errors and invalid results also fall back. Return <code>null</code> explicitly for a successful hit test with no object.</p> <p>Canceled work must still resolve or reject its promise. The browser permits only one <code>hitTest</code> callback in flight and holds that slot until the promise settles, even after cancellation or a timeout. If a worker handles picking, settle the pending promise when its work is aborted; dropping a canceled worker response can block subsequent canvas picking.</p> <p>Call <code>surface?.invalidate()</code> after moving objects or changing zoom, and <code>surface?.dispose()</code> when removing the integration. Both return synchronously without a value.</p> <h3 id=\"add-optional-object-context\">Add optional object context</h3> <p>The <code>id</code> is enough to identify the object. To include a display name, semantic role, hidden context, or selection bounds, replace the successful return in the preceding <code>hitTest</code> callback with:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">return {\n  id: \"revenue-this-quarter\",\n  name: \"Revenue this quarter\",\n  role: \"chart-bar\",\n  metadata: { metricId: \"quarterly-revenue\" },\n  rect,\n};\n</code></pre> <p>The optional <code>name</code> is visible to the user; <code>role</code> gives a short semantic description. Include metadata only when it adds context that isn't already visible. The optional <code>rect</code> uses CSS pixels relative to the visible page area, matching <code>clientX</code> and <code>clientY</code>. The picking example already computes this rectangle. Convert from scene coordinates, including scale, pan, and zoom.</p> <h3 id=\"add-optional-selection-feedback\">Add optional selection feedback</h3> <p>Use the optional <code>renderSelection</code> callback to draw your own hover and selection feedback. It doesn't require the optional context fields.</p> <p>For the canvas above, define this function and add <code>renderSelection: renderRevenueSelection</code> to the <code>registerSurface()</code> options:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">function renderRevenueSelection({ hoveredId, selectedId }) {\n  context.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n  context.fillStyle = \"#2563eb\";\n  context.fillRect(bar.x, bar.y, bar.width, bar.height);\n\n  if (\n    hoveredId === \"revenue-this-quarter\" ||\n    selectedId === \"revenue-this-quarter\"\n  ) {\n    context.strokeStyle = \"#111827\";\n    context.lineWidth = 3;\n    context.strokeRect(bar.x, bar.y, bar.width, bar.height);\n  }\n}\n</code></pre> <p>This callback redraws the bar with an outline while it's hovered or selected. When both IDs are <code>null</code>, it redraws the bar without an outline.</p> <h3 id=\"add-controls-to-canvas-objects\">Add controls to canvas objects</h3> <p>Register custom controls on the surface's DOM element. Drawn objects, called virtual objects in the API, use your custom controls; built-in CSS and text controls don't apply to them.</p> <p>For multiple objects, use <code>renderSelection</code> to update the host's controls when <code>selectedId</code> changes, before the browser captures the annotation. Control events include <code>detail.virtualTarget: { surfaceId, targetId }</code>. Route each event using that captured identity and its <code>callback</code>, rather than the current selection. <code>targetId</code> matches the <code>id</code> from <code>hitTest</code>; <code>surfaceId</code> identifies the browser's surface registration. Ordinary DOM events omit <code>virtualTarget</code>.</p> <p>Preview, comparison, and reset events retain the original object's identity after another object is selected. Reopening a saved annotation doesn't rerun hit testing to replace its captured object or metadata.</p> <h2 id=\"control-annotation-mode\">Control Annotation mode</h2> <p>Use <code>toggle()</code> to request a mode change, <code>isActive()</code> to read confirmed state, and the document's <code>oaiannotationmodechange</code> event to keep your UI in sync. Feature-detect both methods for older or unsupported browsers. Add this button, then run the script after it exists:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;button id=\"toggle-annotations\" type=\"button\" hidden&gt;\n  Enter annotation mode\n&lt;/button&gt;\n</code></pre> <pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const button = document.getElementById(\"toggle-annotations\");\nconst annotation = document.oai?.annotation;\n\nfunction renderMode(active) {\n  button.textContent = active\n    ? \"Exit annotation mode\"\n    : \"Enter annotation mode\";\n}\n\nconst onModeChange = (event) =&gt; renderMode(event.detail.active);\nconst onClick = () =&gt; annotation.toggle(!annotation.isActive());\n\nif (\n  typeof annotation?.toggle === \"function\" &amp;&amp;\n  typeof annotation?.isActive === \"function\"\n) {\n  document.addEventListener(\"oaiannotationmodechange\", onModeChange);\n  button.addEventListener(\"click\", onClick);\n  renderMode(annotation.isActive());\n  button.hidden = false;\n}\n\nfunction cleanupAnnotationButton() {\n  document.removeEventListener(\"oaiannotationmodechange\", onModeChange);\n  button.removeEventListener(\"click\", onClick);\n  button.hidden = true;\n}\n</code></pre> <p><code>toggle()</code> inverts the mode. Pass <code>true</code> to ensure it's on or <code>false</code> to ensure it's off. Repeated requests with the same boolean are idempotent. Passing <code>true</code> preserves an active editor or pending activation; <code>false</code> cancels pending activation and uses the normal exit flow.</p> <p>Call <code>toggle()</code> from a live user interaction. Its synchronous <code>{ accepted }</code> result acknowledges the request, not a confirmed mode change. Browser eligibility checks can still prevent the change. Read state from <code>isActive()</code> and the event, as the example does.</p> <p><code>isActive()</code> needs no user gesture. The browser updates it before dispatching <code>oaiannotationmodechange</code>, whose <code>event.detail.active</code> is a boolean. The browser doesn't send an initial event or a duplicate for a forced no-op, so initialize your UI from the getter. If access is revoked while active, a final event reports <code>active: false</code> and a retained getter returns <code>false</code>.</p> <p>Annotation mode captures page clicks. Hold <strong>Space</strong> to use page controls, including your exit button, or exit through the browser's annotation UI. Holding <strong>Space</strong> alone leaves <code>isActive()</code> true. The API doesn't support an <code>oai-annotation-ignore</code> or other attribute that lets clicks pass through.</p> <p>Exiting closes the editor and preserves saved annotations without submitting them or moving them into the composer. Call <code>cleanupAnnotationButton()</code> when removing the component. The captured API reference lets cleanup remove listeners even if the namespace has disappeared.</p> <h2 id=\"test-your-integration\">Test your integration</h2> <p>Open your website in the desktop app's built-in browser and test the features you added:</p> <ol> <li>Enter Annotation mode and select objects and text. Check that highlights, names, ranges, and metadata match the intended targets.</li> <li>Open an annotation from your site's button. Check the selected element or text range, initial comment, and editor mode.</li> <li>Change a custom control, compare with the original, and clear the preview. Check that your application restores the original state.</li> <li>For canvas content, test empty space, resizing, and scene changes. Switch objects and confirm control events still update the captured target. Cancel an asynchronous hit test and confirm that later picks still work.</li> <li>Save, reopen, and edit an annotation from the composer's attachment preview. Check that it retains its controls and target, and that removing it clears any preview.</li> <li>Send an annotation with a message. Confirm that ChatGPT receives the selected content, metadata, and requested values, including visible select labels and unchanged choices on controls that omit <code>currentValue</code>.</li> <li>Open the site in a browser without the API and verify that normal interactions still work.</li> </ol> <p>To expose actions ChatGPT can take on your website, add <a href=\"#/article/a-d8e7ab2e8f18b498\">Site tools (WebMCP)</a>. Annotations bring the person's selection and feedback into the conversation; site tools let the agent act on that context through your application's existing capabilities.</p>"};
